+
+Request: `createPatch(from, to)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, returns a JSON Patch (RFC 6902) that turns `from` into `to`.
+
+Done: inputs are not mutated; the patch descends into objects and arrays and touches only what differs
+(identical documents give `[]`); array insert/delete give a single `add`/`remove` (LCS on deep equality,
+neighbours untouched); a moved item is a `remove` plus an `add`; type changes give `replace`; pointer
+tokens are escaped; `__proto__` is an ordinary member.
+Tests: `test/createpatch.test.ts` (minimality cases plus 2000 randomized round trips through `applyPatch`). `npm test` passes.
